{"about_the_game":"Embark on a 3D rolling journey with <i>&quot;Just Roll&quot;</i>, an indie game developed with passion using Unreal Engine. Navigate through intricate mazes, overcome challenging obstacles, and discover the unyielding spirit within. Every turn is a puzzle, and every moment is a lesson in physics, strategy, and sheer will.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Dynamic Gameplay</strong>: Master the art of rolling as you traverse through various landscapes filled with surprises at every curve.<br></li><li><strong>Stunning Visuals</strong>: Dive into a beautifully chaotic world created with Unreal Engine, showcasing detailed environments and atmospheric effects.<br></li><li><strong>Challenging Levels</strong>: Each level brings its own set of challenges, pushing you to learn and adapt. How fast can you think and roll?<br></li><li><strong>Engaging Physics</strong>: Experience the realistic and sometimes unpredictable physics. Will you gently roll down the hill or launch into the air?</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"No Pain, No Win","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2763590/1fba288dfa0c9040cb856c52cd4c57be6b747882.jpg"},{"name":"Welcome to the paradise","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2763590/2b0be19b68bc62a0577c3be8a6e7f93042ce68ec.jpg"},{"name":"Good Job Tryhard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2763590/2fc0465b61cc261322c8dc00bfdd58fdca1ceb15.jpg"},{"name":"First Bad Choice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2763590/36dc457a4363694b4d25123ec22063ff650dd805.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2763590?t=1707487204","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2763590?t=1707487204","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steam